# Drivnod, Carnage Dominus: "{B/P}{B/P}, Exile three creature cards from your graveyard: Put an indestructible counter on
# Drivnod." The exile is a cost (CR 601.2h, 602.2b): with two Ornithopters (two Entombs on turn 3), two Entombs and a Black
# Lotus in its graveyard Bot1 cannot activate it, though it could pay the Phyrexian symbols with life. On turn 5 two more
# Entombs put a third Ornithopter and a Lightning Bolt there: Bot1 pays both {B/P} with 2 life each (CR 107.4f), may not
# choose the Bolt among the cards it exiles, exiles the three Ornithopters, and Drivnod gets an indestructible counter.

